p1 meta lang.pattern.p1 stated "track daily habits from the terminal => concept habit.overview \"the tool tracks daily habits in a terminal\"" @gen:d21d2d78f2af1e38
p2 meta lang.pattern.p2 stated "the first argument names the habit to print => concept habit.cli.argument \"argv[1] is the habit to render\"" @gen:d21d2d78f2af1e38
p3 meta lang.pattern.p3 stated "read the habit log from the file named as the second argument, or from standard input when no file is named => concept habit.cli.input \"argv[2] is the log file, else stdin\"" @gen:d21d2d78f2af1e38
p4 meta lang.pattern.p4 stated "each log line holds an iso date and a habit name separated by a tab => concept habit.log.format \"tab separated date and habit per line\"" @gen:d21d2d78f2af1e38
p5 meta lang.pattern.p5 stated "print one character per day from the log's earliest date to its latest date => concept habit.output.span \"one character per day over the log's whole span\"" @gen:d21d2d78f2af1e38
p6 meta lang.pattern.p6 stated "mark a day the named habit was logged with <mark> => fact habit.mark.logged \"<mark>\"" @gen:d21d2d78f2af1e38
p7 meta lang.pattern.p7 stated "mark a day it was not logged with <mark> => fact habit.mark.missing \"<mark>\"" @gen:d21d2d78f2af1e38
p8 meta lang.pattern.p8 stated "install the tool as the command <name> => fact cmd.<name>.install \"<name>\"" @gen:d21d2d78f2af1e38
p9 meta lang.pattern.p9.under.p8 stated "given the log of <d1> for \"<h1>\", <d2> for <h2> and <d3> for \"<h3>\", the habit <q> prints <out> => fact witness.<name>.<q> \"<d1> <h1> <d2> <h2> <d3> <h3> <out>\"" @gen:d21d2d78f2af1e38
q1 meta engine.demand.q1 stated "demand habit.mark.logged \"which character marks a day the habit was logged?\"" @gen:d21d2d78f2af1e38
q2 meta engine.demand.q2 stated "demand habit.mark.missing \"which character marks a day the habit was not logged?\"" @gen:d21d2d78f2af1e38
q3 meta engine.demand.q3 stated "demand cmd.<name>.install \"what command name should the tool be installed as?\"" @gen:d21d2d78f2af1e38
q4 meta engine.demand.q4 stated "demand witness.<name>.<q> \"give one example log and the characters the tool must print for it\"" @gen:d21d2d78f2af1e38
r6 meta engine.rule.r6 stated "match fact habit.mark.logged => artifact.<self>.fill.mark_logged \"\\\"<value>\\\"\"" @gen:d21d2d78f2af1e38
r7 meta engine.rule.r7 stated "match fact habit.mark.missing => artifact.<self>.fill.mark_missing \"\\\"<value>\\\"\"" @gen:d21d2d78f2af1e38
r8 meta engine.rule.r8 stated "match fact cmd.<name>.install => artifact.<self>.builder \"\\\"buildGoModule\\\"\" ; artifact.<self>.args.pname \"\\\"<value>\\\"\" ; artifact.<self>.args.version \"\\\"0.1.0\\\"\" ; artifact.<self>.args.src \"./artifacts/<self>\" ; artifact.<self>.args.vendorHash \"null\" ; artifact.<self>.fill.name \"\\\"<value>\\\"\" ; home.packages \"[ ${artifact.<self>} ]\"" @gen:d21d2d78f2af1e38
r9 meta engine.rule.r9 stated "match fact witness.<name>.<q> => claim.<q>.run \"\\\"${artifact.<self>}/bin/<name> <q>\\\"\" ; claim.<q>.stdin \"\\\"<value.1>\\\\t<value.2>\\\\n<value.3>\\\\t<value.4>\\\\n<value.5>\\\\t<value.6>\\\\n\\\"\" ; claim.<q>.stdout \"\\\"<value.7>\\\"\" ; claim.<q>.exit \"0\"" @gen:d21d2d78f2af1e38
